- tests/settlement.test.ts — new describe blocks: market is locked before a storehouse, available once built, and costs 20 wood/15 stone; sellResource covers 2:1 conversion, floor rounding on odd amounts, over-sell clamping, selling stone itself (the clobber case), and the no-market throw.

